  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<para>For questions 1 - 2, decide whether each statement is true or false.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="a0bf2041-1f13-4d4f-89ca-4d2cb952cfe9"><problem><para>
      <para>\(x(x−5)=0\) has only one solution.</para>
      </para></problem><solution><para>False</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is false. </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
